// # Fleet Package Anchor - The Anchor Of The Package Version Sweep
//
// Logline: Re-exports the scan of the fleet, the rewrite of the version and the flow that merges the change.
//
// Setup: Pure shim re-exporting every fleetpkg subsystem anchor.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Re-export the scan of the tools whose packaging files carry a stale version.
//   2. Re-export the rewrite of the version in the packaging files.
//   3. Re-export the flow that opens and merges the pull request of one tool.

import "fleetpkg/pkg_scan.oo";
import "fleetpkg/pkg_bump.oo";
import "fleetpkg/pkg_flow.oo";
